title UC.26 - Security & Access Enforcement (RBAC Matrix, Session JTI & Email OTP)

|User / IT Administrator|
start
if (Select Security Enforcement Flow?) then (Flow 1: Dynamic RBAC Matrix [FR58])
  :Open 2D RBAC Permissions Matrix & modify role permissions;
  :Click Save Changes;
  |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
  if (Removes core it_admin rights? [Self-Lockout]) then (Yes [E1])
    :Block update & return Self-Lockout protection error;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Persist updated grid in rbac_permissions_matrix table;
    |Redis Cache / SMTP Service|
    :Invalidate RBAC permission cache in Redis;
    |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
    :Write Audit Log (RBAC_MATRIX_UPDATED);
    stop
  endif
elseif (Flow 2: Single Active Session [FR59]) then
  |User / IT Administrator|
  :User logs in on Device B while Device A session is active;
  |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
  :Verify credentials & detect active session jti_A;
  :Update jti_A status = REVOKED in user_active_sessions;
  |Redis Cache / SMTP Service|
  :Set blacklist:jti_A = true in Redis (TTL = 7 days);
  |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
  :Issue new JWT with jti_B to Device B;
  |User / IT Administrator|
  :Device A sends subsequent API request with jti_A;
  |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
  :AuthMiddleware checks Redis blacklist & detects revoked jti_A;
  :Return HTTP 401 Unauthorized (CONCURRENT_LOGIN_KICKED);
  |User / IT Administrator|
  :Device A clears local credentials & redirects to Login page;
  stop
else (Flow 3: Email OTP Password Recovery [FR60])
  |User / IT Administrator|
  :Select Forgot Password & submit registered email;
  |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
  :Generate 6-digit OTP (TTL = 300s, max 3 attempts)\nand save hash in password_reset_tokens;
  |Redis Cache / SMTP Service|
  :Send 6-digit OTP email via SMTP Server;
  |User / IT Administrator|
  :Enter 6-digit OTP code;
  |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
  if (OTP valid, <= 300s & attempts < 3?) then (No [E2/E3])
    :Increment attempts / invalidate expired OTP & return error;
    stop
  else (Yes)
    :Issue one-time reset_token;
    |User / IT Administrator|
    :Enter & confirm new password;
    |GraphMind Auth & Security Service|
    :Hash password with bcrypt, update users table\nand revoke all active user sessions;
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml